              "originalPosition": 13,
              "body": "```suggestion\n| **BusBW** (Bus Bandwidth) | Effective per-accelerator throughput during a collective operation. See the BusBW definition and reporting requirements in {{!TERMINOLOGY}}. Additionally, the runtime algorithm selected by the collective library MUST be verified via library tracing and documented as part of the test conditions |\n```",
              "createdAt": "2026-05-13T03:20:11Z",
