            },
            {
              "originalPosition": 31,
              "body": "```suggestion\nWhen UET group keying is active during testing, the observed BusBW computed from measured bytes transferred is reported. The observed transfer volume reflects group keying behavior.The algo_factor defined in {{!TERMINOLOGY}} (fixed per collective type) still applies to the formula; \n```",
              "createdAt": "2026-05-13T03:25:09Z",
